Scoped Sierra SOL demuxer

The sol_probe magic and tag check, the old (0x0B8D) and new (0x0C0D, 0x0C8D)
header layouts with their 13- or 14-byte data offset, the sol_codec_id and
sol_channels type-bit mapping and the 4096-byte packet span in src/sol.ts
follow libavformat/sol.c (sol_probe, sol_codec_id, sol_channels,
sol_read_header, sol_read_packet) and pcm.c (ff_pcm_read_seek).
Fixed FFmpeg commit:946fcce07b6dcd0331c8cc609192aeff5e1924f8
